The '''Spider Artifact''' is an {{Epic}} [[Accessory]] that reduces the damage taken from {{mt|Arthropod}} mobs by {{Green|15%}}. It requires {{Coll|Spider Slayer 6}}. It is the upgraded form of the [[Spider Ring]] and is the final form of the [[Spider Talisman]].

